First verify that the packaged token-output graph supports this path, and reconstruct current whole-window pooling before evaluating new boundaries. A pooled-only TECH-02 export cannot recover discarded token states: retain a separately fingerprinted unpooled research export if this experiment proceeds. Do not enable both paths together and attribute their combined effects to either. Promote only if finer time boundaries and recurrence pass R5 without introducing overlap smearing or unacceptable memory/inference cost.

